      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "USDnr\n\nDescription\nWeb2-style on-ramp into partner asset flow.\n\nProblem it solves\nUsers need a familiar funding route without crypto-first setup.\n\nCurrent issues\nPartner modal is not yet deeply app-aware.\n\nTODOs\nPre-fill smart account, asset, campaign, and success callback.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "USDnr\n\nDescription\nWeb2-style on-ramp into partner asset flow.\n\nProblem it solves\nUsers need a familiar funding route without crypto-first setup.\n\nCurrent issues\nPartner modal is not yet deeply app-aware.\n\nTODOs\nPre-fill smart account, asset, campaign, and success callback.",
      "lineHeight": 1.18,
      "baseline": 249
