      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reputation\n\nDescription: Fluent families and reputation signals for the authenticated Fluent ID.\nProblem it solves: builders need trust, segmentation, and personalization.\nCurrent issues: lookup requires the Privy ID from the Fluent session.\nTODOs: define cache policy, labels, empty state, and privacy boundaries.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reputation\n\nDescription: Fluent families and reputation signals for the authenticated Fluent ID.\nProblem it solves: builders need trust, segmentation, and personalization.\nCurrent issues: lookup requires the Privy ID from the Fluent session.\nTODOs: define cache policy, labels, empty state, and privacy boundaries.",
      "lineHeight": 1.18,
      "baseline": 136
    }
